roduct $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(1,-2),(-3,1),(3,2).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186256537 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a7c5f3b1-bdaf-557c-ac51-ff5fd31112b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462025} {:answer/id #uuid "861319a6-c6db-5433-8213-e3a18c50d19e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462026}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462025} :answer-field/id #uuid "fbe6f948-2607-53e1-b874-9f8f59ccc40c" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462766} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b24f95c-90a3-5a5a-ae57-b4f8a57c59cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462027} {:answer/id #uuid "4229d154-8cb1-504b-8112-ba7ec17b0cc1" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462028}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462028} :answer-field/id #uuid "4230d7b5-411d-5c56-9b00-ecef8de6fe1d" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462767} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "769d12c6-3cf7-50a2-8ddf-301bc2d70dab" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186462029} {:answer/id #uuid "eea03a12-a2a2-574c-bea1-9faabb81195f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb