angle of ${270}^{∘}$ about the origin?\n- **I.** $(1,0)$\n- **II.** $(0,-1)$\n- **III.** $(-2,1)$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The counterclockwise rotation ${R}_{{270}^{∘}}$ by an angle of ${270}^{∘}$ is given by the matrix\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the image of $S$ under the action of ${R}_{{270}^{∘}},$ we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $S:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under ${R}_{{270}^{∘}}$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(1,0),(0,1),(-2,1).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I and III only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278330 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "7fe79dd6-c716-5e68-857e-e038518fca35" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465333} {:answer/id #uuid "42bcd087-2518-5e88-afed-7691dd99a8de" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465334}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465333} :answer-field/id #uuid "66a182a1-2acc-53e0-8f50-9bcee85d849e" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466510} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "96e59229-1dd5-5a62-9027-56ad581b64aa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465335} {:answer/id #uuid "a6958587-2c98-53bb-a4bc-0113b92949fe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :d