lockwise rotation ${R}_{-\\pi /2}$ by an angle of $\\frac{\\pi }{2}$ radians is the same as counterclockwise rotation by an angle of $\\frac{3\\pi }{2}.$ It's given by the matrix\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the image of $S$ under the action of ${R}_{-\\pi /2},$ we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $S:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under ${R}_{-\\pi /2}$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}5 & 2 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ -5 & -2 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(-1,-5),(0,-2),(-1,2).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278333 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c65752e0-6e2e-5f72-b25d-1d72c342a96b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465351} {:answer/id #uuid "eab58d28-c443-5176-a039-e1fa9838636c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465352}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465352} :answer-field/id #uuid "1ec3023b-35de-57b2-824e-9b649769e148" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466519} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "cbd8a6c5-ad41-5cf7-b3bc-dcb90d2ac81a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465353} {:answer/id #uuid "01666383-14af-5f55-8b80-78c4e4a00351" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465354}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/iden