gle of ${90}^{∘}$ is the same as counterclockwise rotation by an angle of ${270}^{∘}.$ It's given by the matrix\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the image of $S$ under the action of ${R}_{-{90}^{∘}},$ we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $S:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under ${R}_{-{90}^{∘}}$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -3 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(2,0),(0,-3),(0,0).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I, II, and III.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186354291 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6447923e-3191-5c08-b560-016a9cca81ca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469362} {:answer/id #uuid "0cc433cf-3e13-565e-b11d-47ebc6009d0b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469363}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469363} :answer-field/id #uuid "0cdb2ef9-a7f4-5197-a4be-9be3babb8318" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186470293} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b6f89934-e7fc-5003-8d75-d813ae4eddf0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469364} {:answer/id #uuid "bb820a21-e923-56ac-bab5-b0c3ae2a331f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469365}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186469