the image of $X$ under ${R}_{-\\pi }$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(1,0),(-1,0),(-2,-1).$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"I and II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278284 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "860349c8-173d-5019-b9b1-6a749e559391" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464660} {:answer/id #uuid "a52a88d3-fd94-5bdf-964b-c4f80ad6e956" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464661}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464660} :answer-field/id #uuid "3cc4e518-875b-5dfa-a0fb-74b8adac3e90" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465264} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "62d845ac-ccb8-5467-b38d-90abaf5f3a58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464662} {:answer/id #uuid "a9af05f4-f984-5b2a-9142-c3d89e4d8f82" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464663}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464662} :answer-field/id #uuid "47750f67-891e-5e68-8b62-9018f06dcf68" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465265} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9bb5e56c-9d06-51c9-881a-dc43682b63b0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186464664} {:answer/id #uuid "d562358e-0faf-5c51-8b43-8abf16141aa5" :answer/t