e origin?\n- **I.** $(-6,-1)$\n- **II.** $(4,-1)$\n- **III.** $(3,-5)$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "The counterclockwise rotation ${R}_{{180}^{∘}}$ by an angle of ${180}^{∘}$ is given by the matrix\n\n$$\nR=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTo find the image of $S$ under the action of ${R}_{{180}^{∘}},$ we first create a matrix $X$ containing all of the vertices of $S:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}X & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we compute the image of $X$ under ${R}_{{180}^{∘}}$ by calculating the matrix product $RX:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}RX & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -1 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the coordinates of the respective vertices of ${S}^{′}$ are $(-6,1),(4,-1),(-3,-5).$ \n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II only.\""} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186278286 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e2af2881-a673-5b57-bd3a-7b0a0c5b9c42" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465273} {:answer/id #uuid "c5fbbe59-f0e2-5ee8-aafd-3b934b1b4ae6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465274}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465274} :answer-field/id #uuid "7bae1bf3-33e4-529f-8225-d16d80ad6410" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186466480} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "08ae369b-d1e0-5cc4-abd5-07b211cf5919" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465275} {:answer/id #uuid "a987fc9f-5e71-51cd-943f-f07a66df7ee2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186465276