| {{field-4}} |  |  |" :question/worked-solution "Given a function $f$ and a diagonal matrix $D$ with diagonal entries ${\\lambda }_{1},…,{\\lambda }_{n},$ we have\n\n$$\nf(D)=\\begin{bmatrix}f({\\lambda }_{1}) & ⋯ & 0 \\\\ ⋮ & ⋱ & ⋮ \\\\ 0 & ⋯ & f({\\lambda }_{n})\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2}^{D} & =\\begin{bmatrix}{2}^{3} & 0 \\\\ 0 & {2}^{-2}\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}8 & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\frac{1}{4}\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292545 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "52378cfc-0dd2-5bad-bfd6-171ba113ef4e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290983}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290983} :answer-field/id #uuid "4c205653-bf75-5cec-bc5b-791b78cd2ecc" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291975} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6b98c234-82a7-52e4-8660-adf687e02c41" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291097}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291097} :answer-field/id #uuid "8232bcef-e69f-588b-b46b-ce7c5a4ab8cf" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292136} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "f6af9bf9-8c4f-575c-8001-67ddc5fd61a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291671}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291671} :answer-field/id #uuid "9c49cec6-ebe8-5a63-9ab1-2fce82dd1e56" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292230} {:answer-field/cho